cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "What the camera saw: a reliability tag for defensive metrics from broadcast tracking"
authors:
  - family-names: "Sánchez Rueda"
    given-names: "Javier"
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/javiersr1996/what-the-camera-saw"
abstract: >-
  Entry to the SkillCorner x PySport Analytics Cup 2.0 (football). Tags defensive metrics
  computed from SkillCorner broadcast tracking with how many of their players the camera saw,
  separates the fill error (amputation) from the selection of the moments shown whole, and
  publishes a pre-registered question killed by its own rule.
keywords:
  - football
  - tracking data
  - broadcast tracking
  - reliability
  - SkillCorner
